      "hash64": "ABD98A4A134AAFD5",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]OK, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Time to put\\nour\\r\\ngame\\r\\nfaces\\r\\nback on![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
